        "content": "<p>Hi everyone! I am launching <a href=\"http://blueagi.com\">blueagi.com</a> today. It's a web lean assistant &amp; soon a collaborative proof writing tool with a built-in AI assistant (with Python / Lean, git and CI/CD capabilities). </p>\n<p>You can find it here: <a href=\"https://blueagi.com\">https://blueagi.com</a> (if it doesn't work, it means that the traffic is too high and/or we're running out of LLM credits)</p>\n<p>I'd love to hear your thoughts &amp; feedback. What would you like to see in a collaborative proof writing tool? (some of my thoughts can be found here: <a href=\"https://buildermath.substack.com/p/lines-and-universes\">https://buildermath.substack.com/p/lines-and-universes</a>)</p>\n<p><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/Id3ZENlGc9qdAkbNG8e7u4uh/blue1.png\">blue1.png</a><br>\n<a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/YyeyA9T5jnbNmykhfLPmpbEJ/blue2.png\">blue2.png</a><br>\n<a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/31odMrukSDN5oX4CHV5oK8Ct/blue3.png\">blue3.png</a><br>\n<a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/4aLMJwpyQ4UgV_RPWA0LEl30/blue4.png\">blue4.png</a></p>\n<div class=\"message_inline_image\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/Id3ZENlGc9qdAkbNG8e7u4uh/blue1.png\" title=\"blue1.png\"><img src=\"/user_uploads/3121/Id3ZENlGc9qdAkbNG8e7u4uh/blue1.png\"></a></div><div class=\"message_inline_image\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/YyeyA9T5jnbNmykhfLPmpbEJ/blue2.png\" title=\"blue2.png\"><img src=\"/user_uploads/3121/YyeyA9T5jnbNmykhfLPmpbEJ/blue2.png\"></a></div><div class=\"message_inline_image\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/31odMrukSDN5oX4CHV5oK8Ct/blue3.png\" title=\"blue3.png\"><img src=\"/user_uploads/3121/31odMrukSDN5oX4CHV5oK8Ct/blue3.png\"></a></div><div class=\"message_inline_image\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/4aLMJwpyQ4UgV_RPWA0LEl30/blue4.png\" title=\"blue4.png\"><img src=\"/user_uploads/3121/4aLMJwpyQ4UgV_RPWA0LEl30/blue4.png\"></a></div><p>Best,<br>\nMike</p>",
